        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>资金同业业务 - 银行业务关键指标</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        color: #333;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px 60px;\n        position: relative;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .container {\n        max-width: 900px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .right-tab {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 0;\n        top: 220px;\n        background-color: #e66a38;\n        color: white;\n        writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n        padding: 25px 10px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        border-top-left-radius: 8px;\n        border-bottom-left-radius: 8px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        z-index: 10;\n    }\n    \n    .section-title {\n        color: #007b5e;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .intro-text {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    \n    .feature-row {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n    .feature-left {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        width: 160px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .feature-title {\n        writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n        color: #e66a38;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        letter-spacing: 6px;\n        margin-right: 20px;\n    }\n    .feature-icon.placeholder {\n        width: 65px;\n        height: 65px;\n        border: 2px solid #e66a38;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #e66a38;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 5px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        background-color: transparent;\n    }\n    .feature-desc {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #555;\n        flex-grow: 1;\n        padding-top: 5px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    \n    table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    th {\n        color: #e66a38;\n        font-weight: normal;\n        text-align: right;\n        padding: 10px 5px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #e66a38;\n        width: 22%;\n    }\n    th:first-child {\n        text-align: left;\n        color: #b3b3b3;\n        width: auto;\n    }\n    td {\n        padding: 10px 5px;\n        text-align: right;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    td:first-child {\n        text-align: left;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n    .sub-header td {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        padding-top: 20px;\n        padding-bottom: 5px;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n    .indent td:first-child {\n        padding-left: 2em;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    .bold-val {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    .table-bottom-line td {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #e66a38;\n        padding-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    \n    .notes {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #888;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n        padding-left: 5px;\n    }\n    .note-line {\n        display: flex;\n    }\n    .note-label {\n        width: 25px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    \n    .footer {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #888;\n        padding-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .footer-left {\n        color: #e66a38;\n    }\n    .footer-right {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .footer-right span {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-left: 10px;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"right-tab\">经营情况讨论及分析</div>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">资金同业业务</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        平安银行资金同业业务通过“投资交易+客户业务”双轮驱动，持续提升投资、交易和销售三大能力，助力金融市场高质量发展。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"feature-row\">\n        <div class=\"feature-left\">\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">投资交易</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-icon placeholder\">[Icon: Document with arrows and Yen]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-desc\">\n            平安银行加强宏观分析研判，在保障资产端的流动性与安全性前提下，优化交易策略，合理配置持仓组合，保持稳健投资。2024年，平安银行债券交易量的市场份额为4.4%，同比上升1.2个百分点。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"feature-row\">\n        <div class=\"feature-left\">\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">客户业务</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-icon placeholder\">[Icon: Person with document and check]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-desc\">\n            平安银行依托客户综合服务优势，在做市、避险、机构销售、托管等多领域积极发力。2024年，平安银行境内外机构销售的现券交易量4.54万亿元，同比增长46.0%；在平安银行办理外汇即期及衍生品避险业务的客户达14,987户，同比增长16.5%；截至2024年12月31日，通过“行e通”平台销售的资管产品保有规模2,667.05亿元，较年初增长33.2%；托管净值规模达9.10万亿元，较年初增长4.6%。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top: 60px;\">银行业务关键指标</div>\n    \n    <table>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>(人民币百万元)</th>\n                <th>2024年</th>\n                <th>2023年</th>\n                <th>变动(%)</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"sub-header\">\n                <td colspan=\"4\">经营成果</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>营业收入</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">146,695</td>\n                <td>164,699</td>\n                <td>(10.9)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>净利润</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">44,508</td>\n                <td>46,455</td>\n                <td>(4.2)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>成本收入比(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">27.66</td>\n                <td>27.90</td>\n                <td>下降0.24个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>平均总资产收益率(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">0.78</td>\n                <td>0.85</td>\n                <td>下降0.07个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>加权平均净资产收益率(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">10.08</td>\n                <td>11.38</td>\n                <td>下降1.30个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>净息差(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">1.87</td>\n                <td>2.38</td>\n                <td>下降0.51个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <table>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>(人民币百万元)</th>\n                <th>2024年12月31日</th>\n                <th>2023年12月31日</th>\n                <th>变动</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"sub-header\">\n                <td colspan=\"4\">存贷款业务<sup>(1)</sup></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>吸收存款</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">3,533,678</td>\n                <td>3,407,295</td>\n                <td>3.7%</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"indent\">\n                <td>其中：个人存款</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">1,287,180</td>\n                <td>1,207,618</td>\n                <td>6.6%</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"indent\">\n                <td>企业存款</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">2,246,498</td>\n                <td>2,199,677</td>\n                <td>2.1%</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>发放贷款和垫款总额</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">3,374,103</td>\n                <td>3,407,509</td>\n                <td>(1.0%)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"indent\">\n                <td>其中：个人贷款</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">1,767,168</td>\n                <td>1,977,719</td>\n                <td>(10.6%)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"indent\">\n                <td>企业贷款</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">1,606,935</td>\n                <td>1,429,790</td>\n                <td>12.4%</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"sub-header\">\n                <td colspan=\"4\">资产质量</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>不良贷款率(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">1.06</td>\n                <td>1.06</td>\n                <td>-</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>拨备覆盖率(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">250.71</td>\n                <td>277.63</td>\n                <td>下降26.92个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>逾期60天以上贷款偏离度<sup>(2)</sup></td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">0.80</td>\n                <td>0.74</td>\n                <td>上升0.06</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"sub-header\">\n                <td colspan=\"4\">资本充足率</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"table-bottom-line\">\n                <td>核心一级资本充足率<sup>(3)</sup>(%)</td>\n                <td class=\"bold-val\">9.12</td>\n                <td>9.22</td>\n                <td>下降0.10个百分点</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"note-line\">\n            <div class=\"note-label\">注：</div>\n            <div>(1) 吸收存款、发放贷款和垫款总额及其明细项目均为不含息金额。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"note-line\">\n            <div class=\"note-label\"></div>\n            <div>(2) 逾期60天以上贷款偏离度=逾期60天以上贷款余额 / 不良贷款余额。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"note-line\">\n            <div class=\"note-label\"></div>\n            <div>(3) 核心一级资本充足率的最低监管要求为7.75%。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n        <div class=\"footer-right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司 <span>51</span></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
